ng?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\\\" data-file-width=\\\"360\\\" data-file-height=\\\"360\\\" /></a></span><i><a href=\\\"/wiki/nome_proprio\\\" title=\\\"nome proprio\\\">Nome proprio</a></i></h3><span class=\\\"mw-editsection\\\"><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">[</span><a href=\\\"/w/index.php?title=Pangea&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\\\" title=\\\"Modifica la sezione Nome proprio\\\"><span>modifica</span></a><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">]</span></span></div> \\n<figure typeof=\\\"mw:File/Thumb\\\"><a href=\\\"/w/index.php?title=File:Pangaea_continents.svg&amp;lang=it\\\" class=\\\"mw-file-description\\\"><img src=\\\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cb/Pangaea_continents.svg/langit-250px-Pangaea_continents.svg.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" width=\\\"250\\\" height=\\\"294\\\" class=\\\"mw-file-element\\\" srcset=\\\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cb/Pangaea_continents.svg/langit-500px-Pangaea_continents.svg.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\\\" data-file-width=\\\"815\\\" data-file-height=\\\"960\\\" /></a><figcaption>ricostruzione di <b>Pangea</b><small></small></figcaption></figure>\\n<p><b>Pangea</b><small>&#160;(<span typeof=\\\"mw:File\\\"><a href=\\\"/wiki/File:Wikipedia-logo-v2.svg\\\" class=\\\"mw-file-description\\\" title=\\\"Wikipedia\\\"><img alt=\\\"Wikipedia\\\" src=\\\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/80/Wikipedia-logo-v2.svg/20px-Wikipedia-logo-v2.svg.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" width=\\\"20\\\" height=\\\"18\\\" class=\\\"mw-file-element\\\" srcset=\\\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/80/Wikipedia-logo-v2.svg/40px-Wikipedia-logo-v2.svg.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\\\" data-file-width=\\\"103\\\" data-file-height=\\\"94\\\" /></a></span> <b><a href=\\\"https://it.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pangea\\\" class=\\\"extiw\\\" title=\\\"w:Pangea\\\">approfondimento</a></b>)</small> <i>f</i>\\n</p>\\n<ol><li><small>(<i><a href=\\\"/wiki/storia\\\" title=\\\"storia\\\">storia</a></i>)</small> <small>(<i><a href=\\\"/wiki/geografia\\\" title=\\\"geografia\\\">geografia</a></i>)</small> <small>(<i><a href=\\\"/wiki/geologia\\\" title=\\\"geologia\\\">geologia</a></i>)</small> antico <a href=\\\"/wiki/continente\\\" title=\\\"continente\\\">continente</a> esistito nella remota <a href=\\\"/wiki/preistoria\\\" title=\\\"preistoria\\\">preistoria</a> <a href=\\\"/wiki/terrestre\\\" title=\\\"terrestre\\\">terrestre</a> e formato dall'<a href=\\\"/wiki/unione\\\" title=\\\"unione\\\">unione</a> di tutte le <a href=\\\"/wiki/terre\\\" title=\\\"terre\\\">terre</a> <a href=\\\"/wiki/emerse\\\" title=\\\"emerse\\\">emerse</a> esistenti sul <a href=\\\"/wiki/pianeta\\\" title=\\\"pianeta\\\">pianeta</a>; da esso sono in seguito derivati (attraverso numerosi processi di <a href=\\\"/wiki/frammentazione\\\" title=\\\"frammentazione\\\">frammentazione</a> e <a href=\\\"/wiki/riunificazione\\\" title=\\\"riunificazione\\\">riunificazione</a>) i <a href=\\\"/wiki/continenti\\\" title=\\\"continenti\\\">continenti</a> attuali</li></ol>\\n<div class=\\\"mw-heading mw-heading3\\\"><h3 id=\\\"Etimologia_/_Derivazione\\\"><span id=\\\"Etimologia_.2F_Derivazione\\\"></span><span typeof=\\\"mw:File\\\"><a href=\\\"/wiki/File:Nuvola_kdict_glass.svg\\\" class=\\\"mw-file-description\\\"><img src=\\\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/18/Nuvola_kdict_glass.svg/40px-Nuvola_kdict_glass.svg.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" width=\\\"30\\\" height=\\\"30\\\" class=\\\"mw-file-element\\\" srcset=\\\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/18/Nuvola_kdict_glass.svg/60px-Nuvola_kdict_glass.svg.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\\\" data-file-width=\\\"128\\\" data-file-height=\\\"128\\\" /></a></span><a href=\\\"/wiki/etimologia\\\" title=\\\"etimologia\\\">Etimologia</a> / <a href=\\\"/wiki/derivazione\\\" title=\\\"derivazione\\\">Derivazione</a></h3><span class=\\\"mw-editsection\\\"><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">[</span><a href=\\\"/w/index.php?title=Pangea&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\\\" title=\\\"Modifica la sezione Etimologia / Derivazione\\\"><span>modifica</span></a><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">]</span></span></div>\\n<p>composto del prefisso \\\"<a href=\\\"/wiki/pan-\\\" title=\\\"pan-\\\">pan-</a>\\\", derivato dal <a href=\\\"/wiki/greco\\\" title=\\\"greco\\\">greco</a> <i><a href=\\\"/w/index.php?title=%CF%80%E1%BE%B6%CF%82&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\\\" class=\\\"new\\\" title=\\\"πᾶς (la pagina non esiste)\\\">πᾶς</a></i> e significante \\\"tutto\\\", e di \\\"<a href=\\\"/wiki/Gaia\\\" title=\\\"Gaia\\\">Gaia</a>\\\", dal <a href=\\\"/wiki/greco\\\" title=\\\"greco\\\">greco</a> <i><a href=\\\"/wiki/%CE%93%CE%B1%E1%BF%96%CE%B1\\\" title=\\\"Γαῖα\\\">Γαῖα</a></i> nel senso di \\\"<a href=\\\"/wiki/pianeta\\\" title=\\\"pianeta\\\">pianeta</a> <a href=\\\"/wiki/Terra\\\" title=\\\"Terra\\\">Terra</a>\\\". Il termine è stato coniato dallo scienziato tedesco <a href=\\\"https://it.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alfred_Wegener\\\" class=\\\"extiw\\\" title=\\\"w:Alfred Wegener\\\">Alfred Wegener</a> nel 1915 \\n</p>\\n<div class=\\\"NonModificabile\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"mw-heading mw-heading2\\\"><h2 id=\\\"Note_/_Riferimenti\\\"><span id=\\\"Note_.2F_Riferimenti\\\"></span><span typeof=\\\"mw:File\\\"><a href=\\\"/wiki/File:Nuvola_apps_bookcase.svg\\\" class=\\\"mw-file-description\\\"><img src=\\\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a5/Nuvola_apps_bookcase.svg